  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Sudan Rural Development: Strengthening Smallholders/ Resilience / SORUDEV SSR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention logic is that in a context of multiple fragilities as South Sudan, by enhancing food production and diversification, market access and work opportunities, communities will be less vulnerable to conflicts and extreme climate conditions and will improve livelihoods, thus reducing competition over resources and forced displacement</narrative>
  </description>
